## Overall rules
Components are using React and Typescript. Styles are create with PandaCSS in recipes.

Logic should be separated in a component hook. e.g. Checkbox => useCheckbox

Components must follow a11y guidelines and best practices.

Components should follow the compound component pattern. Each DOM element should be in its own component for better flexibility.

## Structure

A component should have a component file, a story file, a test file and a types file. A barrel file is used to export everything.

- /ComponentName
  - ComponentName.tsx
  - ComponentName.stories.tsx
  - ComponentName.spec.tsx
  - types.ts
  - index.ts 

When importing from an headless component library (Ark UI, Base UI, Radix UI, etc...) always suffix the imported component with `Primitive`.
e.g. `import { Avatar as AvatarPrimitive } from '@ark-ui/react';`


